{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":15,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 15:1"},"A soft answer turneth away wrath: but grievous words stir up anger. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 15:2"},"The tongue of the wise useth knowledge aright: but the mouth of fools poureth out foolishness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 15:3"},"The eyes of the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," in every place, beholding the evil and the good. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 15:4"},"A wholesome tongue ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a tree of life: but perverseness therein ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a breach in the spirit. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 15:5"},"A fool despiseth his father’s instruction: but he that regardeth reproof is prudent. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 15:6"},"In the house of the righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," much treasure: but in the revenues of the wicked is trouble. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 15:7"},"The lips of the wise disperse knowledge: but the heart of the foolish ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["doeth"]}," not so. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 15:8"},"The sacrifice of the wicked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," an abomination to the LORD: but the prayer of the upright ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," his delight. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 15:9"},"The way of the wicked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," an abomination unto the LORD: but he loveth him that followeth after righteousness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 15:10"},"Correction ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," grievous unto him that forsaketh the way: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," he that hateth reproof shall die. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 15:11"},"Hell and destruction ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," before the LORD: how much more then the hearts of the children of men? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 15:12"},"A scorner loveth not one that reproveth him: neither will he go unto the wise. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 15:13"},"A merry heart maketh a cheerful countenance: but by sorrow of the heart the spirit is broken. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 15:14"},"The heart of him that hath understanding seeketh knowledge: but the mouth of fools feedeth on foolishness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 15:15"},"All the days of the afflicted ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," evil: but he that is of a merry heart ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["hath"]}," a continual feast. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 15:16"},"Better ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," little with the fear of the LORD than great treasure and trouble therewith. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 15:17"},"Better ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a dinner of herbs where love is, than a stalled ox and hatred therewith. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 15:18"},"A wrathful man stirreth up strife: but ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["he that is"]}," slow to anger appeaseth strife. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 15:19"},"The way of the slothful ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man is"]}," as an hedge of thorns: but the way of the righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," made plain. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 15:20"},"A wise son maketh a glad father: but a foolish man despiseth his mother. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 15:21"},"Folly ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," joy to ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["him that is"]}," destitute of wisdom: but a man of understanding walketh uprightly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 15:22"},"Without counsel purposes are disappointed: but in the multitude of counsellors they are established. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 15:23"},"A man hath joy by the answer of his mouth: and a word ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["spoken "]},"in due season, how good ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is it! "]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 15:24"},"The way of life ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," above to the wise, that he may depart from hell beneath. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 15:25"},"The LORD will destroy the house of the proud: but he will establish the border of the widow. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 15:26"},"The thoughts of the wicked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," an abomination to the LORD: but ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["the words"]}," of the pure ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," pleasant words. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 15:27"},"He that is greedy of gain troubleth his own house; but he that hateth gifts shall live. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 15:28"},"The heart of the righteous studieth to answer: but the mouth of the wicked poureth out evil things. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:28"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PRO 15:29"},"The LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," far from the wicked: but he heareth the prayer of the righteous. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:29"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"30","sid":"PRO 15:30"},"The light of the eyes rejoiceth the heart: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," a good report maketh the bones fat. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:30"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"31","sid":"PRO 15:31"},"The ear that heareth the reproof of life abideth among the wise. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:31"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"32","sid":"PRO 15:32"},"He that refuseth instruction despiseth his own soul: but he that heareth reproof getteth understanding. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:32"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"33","sid":"PRO 15:33"},"The fear of the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the instruction of wisdom; and before honour ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," humility. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 15:33"}]}]}
